1 REM FBCS GFX-0272
2 REM CLAIM A-13.5.2-TR159
3 REM TYPE GRAPHIC
4 REM STD 13.5.2 l.10506-10525: an external SUB draws its own internal picture Q and the main program,
5 REM which declares the external picture Q, draws the external one.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB E
15 DECLARE EXTERNAL PICTURE Q
30 CALL E
40 DRAW Q
50 END
100 EXTERNAL SUB E
120 PICTURE Q
130 PLOT POINTS: 1,1
140 END PICTURE
145 DRAW Q
150 END SUB
200 EXTERNAL PICTURE Q
230 PLOT POINTS: 2,2
250 END PICTURE
